  "findings": [
    {
      "path": "src/actions/auth-request-patch.ts",
      "finding": "Submit hooks are page-local and removed in finally. Without a hook captureAuthSubmit calls the same submit body. The revised append-only receipt drain is inside captureAuthWrites, reached through probe inventory/target helpers only."
    },
    {
      "path": "src/actions/chat-action-executors.ts",
      "finding": "Only targeted signup moves capture to the submit boundary. Non-targeted requestPatch retains capture(run) followed by complete(receipt). Ordinary signup navigation, fills, click, native observation, signed-in check, fallback and errors are unchanged. signIn, including selected 101a password patch, is unchanged."
    },
    {
      "path": "src/actions/signup-claim-action-executors.ts",
      "finding": "Probe inventory now starts after signup form setup. It still includes signup completion and current-user assertion; ordinary sign-in remains outside inventory. Each discovered write still gets a fresh targeted signup and the same stored-effect assertion branch. Recipe feature closure covers 103a and 103b only."
    },
    {
      "path": "src/stacks/backends/spacetime-browser-session.ts",
      "finding": "The changed finish is startSpacetimeAuthWriteCapture.finish, whose sole production caller is captureAuthWrites. It is not beginSpacetimeAuthObservation.finish or legacy startSpacetimeAuthPatch.receipt; both are unchanged. No widening to ordinary native signup/signin or retained keys."
    }
